1
00:01:27,105 --> 00:01:31,025
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:35,065 --> 00:01:36,185
The sandbag is ready.

3
00:01:36,265 --> 00:01:37,305
It will warm you and drive out the chill.

4
00:01:37,385 --> 00:01:38,465
Let me apply it for you, Director.

5
00:01:45,065 --> 00:01:46,185
I can do it myself.

6
00:01:46,265 --> 00:01:47,265
Director Meng.

7
00:01:47,945 --> 00:01:49,265
Now that you're the Empress-designate,

8
00:01:50,105 --> 00:01:51,425
does that mean from now on

9
00:01:52,225 --> 00:01:54,105
we should deliberately keep our distance?

10
00:01:55,705 --> 00:01:57,065
That isn't what I meant.

11
00:01:59,065 --> 00:02:00,305
What's gotten into you lately?

12
00:02:06,265 --> 00:02:07,305
I was just thinking

13
00:02:08,385 --> 00:02:09,945
how quickly everything can change.

14
00:02:11,145 --> 00:02:12,145
The Office of Public Inquiry...

15
00:02:12,865 --> 00:02:14,025
Is it going to be dissolved?

16
00:02:22,385 --> 00:02:23,545
Look.

17
00:02:23,625 --> 00:02:24,745
Just look at all these gifts they sent.

18
00:02:24,825 --> 00:02:25,665
Aren't they wonderful?

19
00:02:25,745 --> 00:02:27,185
Let's see which of those gossips outside

20
00:02:27,265 --> 00:02:29,265
still dares say a word against our lady.

21
00:02:29,345 --> 00:02:31,305
We owe it to the Second Young Master

22
00:02:31,385 --> 00:02:33,145
for standing by us when we needed him.

23
00:02:33,225 --> 00:02:35,105
You're still calling
him Second Young Master?

24
00:02:36,025 --> 00:02:38,105
You should call him Son-in-law now.

25
00:02:38,185 --> 00:02:39,865
But come to think of it,

26
00:02:39,945 --> 00:02:41,145
I could tell long ago

27
00:02:41,225 --> 00:02:42,985
that our new son-in-law
had feelings for her.

28
00:02:45,305 --> 00:02:46,145
-Madam.
-Madam.

29
00:02:47,665 --> 00:02:49,705
Today's the bride's homecoming banquet.

30
00:02:49,785 --> 00:02:51,145
Go fetch the master of the house.

31
00:02:51,225 --> 00:02:52,545
Tell him to stop fussing over the cooking.

32
00:02:52,625 --> 00:02:53,745
-Yes, Madam.
-Yes, Madam.

33
00:03:00,505 --> 00:03:01,785
Come, Anian.

34
00:03:04,945 --> 00:03:06,425
Now that Zhili has married you,

35
00:03:07,225 --> 00:03:08,745
there are some things I must say.

36
00:03:08,825 --> 00:03:10,545
Whatever happened before,

37
00:03:11,145 --> 00:03:13,705
from now on, you must support each other

38
00:03:13,785 --> 00:03:15,945
and cherish the bond you now share.

39
00:03:16,025 --> 00:03:16,905
Don't worry, Father.

40
00:03:17,465 --> 00:03:19,145
I will treasure Zhili above all else

41
00:03:19,785 --> 00:03:21,825
and never let her suffer
the slightest harm.

42
00:03:24,065 --> 00:03:24,905
Good.

43
00:03:29,905 --> 00:03:30,945
Zhili.

44
00:03:32,465 --> 00:03:34,065
Anian may always give way to you,

45
00:03:34,665 --> 00:03:36,625
but now that you've
married into the Di family,

46
00:03:36,705 --> 00:03:39,385
you mustn't be as willful
as you were at home

47
00:03:39,465 --> 00:03:40,305
or bully Anian.

48
00:03:41,265 --> 00:03:42,385
I may dote on you,

49
00:03:43,025 --> 00:03:44,785
but I'll stand up for Anian too.

50
00:03:46,505 --> 00:03:47,585
Father.

51
00:03:47,665 --> 00:03:49,705
I will be a good daughter-in-law
to the Di family.

52
00:03:51,625 --> 00:03:52,625
Good.

53
00:03:54,785 --> 00:03:55,625
Zhili.

54
00:03:56,425 --> 00:03:58,625
Anian is Marquis Wu's only son.

55
00:03:58,705 --> 00:04:01,505
If you can give the Di family heirs soon,

56
00:04:02,265 --> 00:04:03,345
then our Shen family

57
00:04:03,425 --> 00:04:05,425
we can answer to Marquis Wu's spirit

58
00:04:05,505 --> 00:04:06,825
with a clear conscience.

59
00:04:07,425 --> 00:04:09,785
Father, Zhili loves

60
00:04:09,865 --> 00:04:11,385
your sweet-and-sour ribs most.

61
00:04:11,465 --> 00:04:13,705
When you have time, you must teach me.

62
00:04:13,785 --> 00:04:15,185
Then I can make them for Zhili.

63
00:04:16,065 --> 00:04:17,585
I should have taught you long ago.

64
00:04:21,465 --> 00:04:22,385
If Zhishu heard me say that,

65
00:04:22,465 --> 00:04:24,865
that rascal

66
00:04:25,465 --> 00:04:26,905
would get jealous and compete with you

67
00:04:26,985 --> 00:04:28,425
over who loves Zhili more.

68
00:04:29,425 --> 00:04:31,025
Zhishu always has to join the fun.

69
00:04:31,985 --> 00:04:32,945
You don't know the half of it.

70
00:04:33,025 --> 00:04:34,785
They used to fight over a single rib,

71
00:04:34,865 --> 00:04:35,705
those two siblings,

72
00:04:35,785 --> 00:04:37,505
until their chopsticks became weapons.

73
00:04:38,785 --> 00:04:39,865
But now,

74
00:04:39,945 --> 00:04:41,425
with a husband protecting her,

75
00:04:41,505 --> 00:04:43,425
that rascal won't get
a chance to snatch one.

76
00:04:43,985 --> 00:04:45,265
Brother still hasn't returned.

77
00:04:45,785 --> 00:04:47,585
He even missed my wedding to Anian,

78
00:04:47,665 --> 00:04:49,265
and hasn't sent a single letter home.

79
00:04:49,985 --> 00:04:51,945
Your brother is carrying
out an imperial mission.

80
00:04:52,025 --> 00:04:53,465
He can't leave his post for now.

81
00:04:53,545 --> 00:04:54,465
When he returns,

82
00:04:54,545 --> 00:04:55,825
we'll all have a proper reunion.

83
00:04:56,305 --> 00:04:57,305
Come, Father.

84
00:04:57,385 --> 00:04:58,345
To our reunion.

85
00:04:58,425 --> 00:04:59,545
Come.

86
00:05:05,825 --> 00:05:07,065
Father.

87
00:05:07,145 --> 00:05:09,385
Is your chest hurting
again? Get his medicine!

88
00:05:09,945 --> 00:05:10,905
It's all right.

89
00:05:12,425 --> 00:05:13,425
I'm fine.

90
00:05:13,505 --> 00:05:14,625
It's an old complaint.

91
00:05:15,905 --> 00:05:17,425
It's almost funny.

92
00:05:17,505 --> 00:05:18,625
In the past,

93
00:05:18,705 --> 00:05:21,385
that rascal always made
my chest ache with anger.

94
00:05:22,345 --> 00:05:23,425
And now,

95
00:05:24,625 --> 00:05:26,465
I can't even blame him for it.

96
00:05:44,705 --> 00:05:46,825
Your Majesty...

97
00:05:47,625 --> 00:05:48,465
Your Majesty!

98
00:05:49,305 --> 00:05:50,185
Your Majesty!

99
00:05:50,865 --> 00:05:52,545
An urgent express dispatch from Qingzhou!

100
00:06:03,265 --> 00:06:04,105
Your Majesty...

101
00:06:37,785 --> 00:06:38,825
You rotten boy!

102
00:06:39,665 --> 00:06:41,105
Come out here!

103
00:06:41,185 --> 00:06:42,665
I want to speak to you face-to-face!

104
00:06:42,745 --> 00:06:43,585
Zhishu...

105
00:06:46,985 --> 00:06:48,545
While carrying out his orders,

106
00:06:50,305 --> 00:06:51,225
he encountered danger.

107
00:06:55,145 --> 00:06:56,265
Come out here!

108
00:06:56,345 --> 00:06:57,425
Come out!

109
00:06:58,145 --> 00:06:59,945
I serve with the Qingzhou garrison.

110
00:07:00,025 --> 00:07:01,185
By General Huo's order,

111
00:07:01,265 --> 00:07:02,825
we have escorted Young Lord Shen

112
00:07:04,025 --> 00:07:05,025
home.

113
00:07:10,185 --> 00:07:11,425
You...

114
00:07:11,505 --> 00:07:12,985
You must have made a mistake.

115
00:07:14,025 --> 00:07:15,505
Zhishu would never...

116
00:07:16,265 --> 00:07:17,945
leave without a word

117
00:07:18,025 --> 00:07:19,785
and abandon all of us.

118
00:07:25,585 --> 00:07:26,545
Zhishu.

119
00:07:28,345 --> 00:07:29,305
My son...

120
00:07:31,305 --> 00:07:32,545
Zhishu!

121
00:07:34,265 --> 00:07:35,825
My son...

122
00:07:38,065 --> 00:07:40,385
-Father!
-Father!

123
00:07:47,425 --> 00:07:48,425
You said that on my birthday,

124
00:07:48,505 --> 00:07:50,625
you'd give me that half
of the bronze tally.

125
00:07:50,705 --> 00:07:51,625
By my reckoning,

126
00:07:51,705 --> 00:07:53,825
I won't be back in time.

127
00:07:53,905 --> 00:07:55,665
Can't I have my birthday gift early?

128
00:07:55,745 --> 00:07:56,785
What I said was:

129
00:07:57,425 --> 00:08:00,065
when you can truly stand on your own

130
00:08:00,145 --> 00:08:02,705
and shoulder the Shen
family's duty as a minister,

131
00:08:02,785 --> 00:08:05,185
then you may ask for the
half of the tiger-head tally.

132
00:08:05,985 --> 00:08:06,985
Father!

133
00:08:07,065 --> 00:08:08,785
You're far too stingy.

134
00:08:09,265 --> 00:08:11,905
I've begged you for that
half-tally for three years.

135
00:08:11,985 --> 00:08:12,825
If you still won't give it to me,

136
00:08:12,905 --> 00:08:15,425
-I'll trade my half for wine tomorrow.
-You dare!

137
00:08:16,225 --> 00:08:17,945
You insolent boy!

138
00:08:21,185 --> 00:08:22,985
Father, once I've sold it for wine,

139
00:08:23,065 --> 00:08:24,225
I'll bring you back the
finest jar money can buy.

140
00:08:24,305 --> 00:08:25,385
Before he left,

141
00:08:25,465 --> 00:08:28,145
he proudly told me

142
00:08:28,785 --> 00:08:31,505
he had been appointed
a fourth-rank Censor.

143
00:08:34,545 --> 00:08:36,545
He even asked me for his birthday gift.

144
00:08:37,385 --> 00:08:38,985
I was afraid he would grow conceited,

145
00:08:39,545 --> 00:08:40,745
so I scolded him.

146
00:08:46,745 --> 00:08:48,745
If I'd known it would be
the last time I saw him,

147
00:08:53,505 --> 00:08:54,665
this bronze tally...

148
00:08:56,465 --> 00:08:59,425
would have reached his hands.

149
00:09:01,425 --> 00:09:02,585
Zhishu said

150
00:09:05,465 --> 00:09:07,505
that as soon as he returned,
he'd arrange the wedding

151
00:09:09,025 --> 00:09:10,185
and marry me.

152
00:09:22,465 --> 00:09:23,585
Miss Yan.

153
00:09:23,665 --> 00:09:25,105
This is your birth-date card.

154
00:09:25,785 --> 00:09:26,905
Please take it back.

155
00:09:38,905 --> 00:09:41,745
Before he left, Zhishu
wrote the marriage contract

156
00:09:41,825 --> 00:09:43,145
and prepared the betrothal gift list.

157
00:09:43,225 --> 00:09:46,785
He begged me to prepare the three marriage
documents and six betrothal gifts,

158
00:09:46,865 --> 00:09:48,625
so when he returned,

159
00:09:48,705 --> 00:09:50,945
he could marry you with full honor.

160
00:10:03,745 --> 00:10:06,185
I'd like to see who dares
lay a hand on her today.

161
00:10:07,985 --> 00:10:09,745
Fuzhi, I'm sorry I'm late.

162
00:10:10,505 --> 00:10:12,385
If I, Shen Zhishu, am to marry,

163
00:10:12,465 --> 00:10:13,745
not one of the Six Rites may be omitted,

164
00:10:13,825 --> 00:10:15,265
and all three marriage
documents must be prepared.

165
00:10:15,865 --> 00:10:17,105
When the auspicious day comes,

166
00:10:17,585 --> 00:10:19,345
I will send a grand bridal sedan

167
00:10:20,065 --> 00:10:22,345
and welcome Fuzhi into
the Shen family in honor.

168
00:10:22,425 --> 00:10:23,785
I don't believe Young Lord Shen,

169
00:10:23,865 --> 00:10:26,345
surrounded by all the noble
ladies of the capital,

170
00:10:27,385 --> 00:10:29,585
would truly give up
that garden of beauties

171
00:10:29,665 --> 00:10:31,985
for a merchant's daughter like me

172
00:10:32,065 --> 00:10:33,465
and bind his heart to mine

173
00:10:33,545 --> 00:10:34,905
for the rest of his life.

174
00:10:35,705 --> 00:10:37,385
What if I cut down every peach blossom?

175
00:10:37,465 --> 00:10:39,065
Then...

176
00:10:39,145 --> 00:10:40,905
clear away every last
flower and weed around you,

177
00:10:40,985 --> 00:10:41,985
every one of them,

178
00:10:44,585 --> 00:10:45,705
and ask me again.

179
00:10:46,585 --> 00:10:47,585
I promise you,

180
00:10:47,665 --> 00:10:48,705
if I ever chase another woman again,

181
00:10:48,785 --> 00:10:49,665
you may leave me without another word.

182
00:11:05,305 --> 00:11:06,305
Wait for me to come back.

183
00:11:18,345 --> 00:11:20,265
Zhishu and I never bowed
before Heaven and Earth,

184
00:11:21,265 --> 00:11:22,985
but in my heart, I already chose him.

185
00:11:23,825 --> 00:11:25,265
If you will accept me,

186
00:11:26,185 --> 00:11:27,625
I wish to be a daughter-in-law
of the Shen family.

187
00:11:31,945 --> 00:11:33,025
Silly child.

188
00:11:34,225 --> 00:11:35,585
You're still in the bloom of youth.

189
00:11:35,665 --> 00:11:37,585
Don't sacrifice your whole future.

190
00:11:37,665 --> 00:11:39,465
-Please, get up.
-My mind is made up.

191
00:11:40,985 --> 00:11:41,825
Unless...

192
00:11:45,505 --> 00:11:47,145
you truly cannot accept me.

193
00:11:51,865 --> 00:11:53,705
Only today do I understand

194
00:11:55,105 --> 00:11:58,225
why Zhishu gave his heart to you.

195
00:11:58,865 --> 00:12:01,265
To have you love him so sincerely

196
00:12:01,345 --> 00:12:02,985
was my son's good fortune.

197
00:12:05,225 --> 00:12:06,385
Good child.

198
00:12:07,665 --> 00:12:08,705
Please, get up.

199
00:12:10,785 --> 00:12:11,865
Good child.

200
00:12:12,425 --> 00:12:14,225
From now on, we're one family.

201
00:12:14,305 --> 00:12:15,625
One family.

202
00:12:18,825 --> 00:12:19,745
Father.

203
00:12:23,105 --> 00:12:23,945
Mother.

204
00:12:37,585 --> 00:12:38,825
Rest assured, Director Meng.

205
00:12:38,905 --> 00:12:41,825
This medicine will let Miss
Yan sleep for a full day.

206
00:12:41,905 --> 00:12:43,745
She hasn't closed her
eyes the entire journey.

207
00:12:45,305 --> 00:12:46,785
A little calming tea was the only way

208
00:12:46,865 --> 00:12:48,065
to make her get some proper rest.

209
00:12:51,705 --> 00:12:52,585
Lord Meng.

210
00:12:53,385 --> 00:12:54,425
Manager Yan...

211
00:12:54,985 --> 00:12:55,945
How is she?

212
00:12:56,625 --> 00:12:58,105
What kind of question is that?

213
00:12:58,185 --> 00:13:00,265
Just thinking that we'll never
see Young Lord Shen again

214
00:13:00,345 --> 00:13:01,185
makes my heart ache.

215
00:13:01,865 --> 00:13:03,345
Imagine how the manager must feel.

216
00:13:04,305 --> 00:13:05,585
Only last month, Young Lord Shen

217
00:13:05,665 --> 00:13:07,265
helped us finish blending a new wine.

218
00:13:07,345 --> 00:13:08,745
He said he'd taste it when he came back.

219
00:13:09,225 --> 00:13:11,065
What monster did this to him?

220
00:13:12,345 --> 00:13:13,385
Young Lord Shen

221
00:13:13,465 --> 00:13:15,105
was one of us at the Office too.

222
00:13:16,865 --> 00:13:18,665
I won't let his death go unanswered.

223
00:13:25,305 --> 00:13:26,385
And I won't let you

224
00:13:26,465 --> 00:13:28,345
spend every day drowning in tears.

225
00:13:50,425 --> 00:13:51,665
Your Majesty.

226
00:13:51,745 --> 00:13:53,545
Your wounds from the whip haven't healed.

227
00:13:53,625 --> 00:13:54,625
You mustn't keep practicing.

228
00:13:54,705 --> 00:13:56,745
If they split open again,

229
00:13:56,825 --> 00:13:58,985
how could this old servant
answer to the late Emperor?

230
00:13:59,865 --> 00:14:01,385
I'm wounded,

231
00:14:01,465 --> 00:14:02,985
not dying.

232
00:14:11,905 --> 00:14:12,745
Chief Steward You.

233
00:14:13,425 --> 00:14:14,265
Let me.

234
00:14:16,305 --> 00:14:17,665
Director Meng.

235
00:14:17,745 --> 00:14:19,065
Please talk some sense into His Majesty.

236
00:14:19,145 --> 00:14:20,665
Not only is he practicing
swordplay while wounded,

237
00:14:21,985 --> 00:14:23,945
he hasn't eaten a thing all day.

238
00:14:36,665 --> 00:14:38,265
I know Your Majesty is grieving.

239
00:14:40,505 --> 00:14:42,385
I am willing to avenge Young Lord Shen.

240
00:14:43,145 --> 00:14:44,425
If you discovered

241
00:14:45,465 --> 00:14:47,425
that someone you knew was
in the Blood Moon Society,

242
00:14:48,985 --> 00:14:50,465
what would you do?

243
00:14:51,585 --> 00:14:52,585
Your Majesty, rest assured.

244
00:14:53,825 --> 00:14:55,545
Though Situ Xue and I get along well,

245
00:14:55,625 --> 00:14:57,065
I know where to draw the line.

246
00:14:57,145 --> 00:14:59,305
If the Blood Moon Society
harms Daning's people,

247
00:14:59,385 --> 00:15:00,745
I will show them no mercy.

248
00:15:01,905 --> 00:15:03,425
Your Majesty's wounds haven't healed yet.

249
00:15:04,505 --> 00:15:05,905
Let me apply the medicine.

250
00:15:14,385 --> 00:15:16,145
Your Highness, it is past midnight.

251
00:15:16,705 --> 00:15:18,345
Our contact still hasn't arrived.

252
00:15:18,425 --> 00:15:19,345
Something may have gone wrong.

253
00:15:19,905 --> 00:15:20,905
Wait a little longer.

254
00:15:20,985 --> 00:15:22,185
Your Highness.

255
00:15:22,265 --> 00:15:24,105
The Blood Moon Society cannot be trusted.

256
00:15:24,185 --> 00:15:25,585
Last time, they not only broke their word,

257
00:15:25,665 --> 00:15:27,385
they even killed our secret envoy.

258
00:15:27,465 --> 00:15:29,545
Can you truly trust people

259
00:15:30,465 --> 00:15:31,705
who change their word so easily?

260
00:15:32,265 --> 00:15:34,305
Last time, everything
happened too suddenly.

261
00:15:34,385 --> 00:15:36,785
I've always suspected
there was more to it.

262
00:15:36,865 --> 00:15:39,625
I must negotiate with the Blood
Moon Society in person again.

263
00:15:39,705 --> 00:15:40,785
But the First Prince

264
00:15:40,865 --> 00:15:42,465
strongly favors a policy of conciliation.

265
00:15:43,105 --> 00:15:44,265
This time,

266
00:15:44,345 --> 00:15:46,105
if Your Highness contacts
the Blood Moon Society,

267
00:15:46,185 --> 00:15:47,025
I fear...

268
00:15:47,545 --> 00:15:49,145
My elder brother

269
00:15:49,225 --> 00:15:50,505
is indecisive

270
00:15:50,585 --> 00:15:51,945
and hopelessly naive.

271
00:15:52,025 --> 00:15:54,225
Does he truly think one marriage pact

272
00:15:54,305 --> 00:15:55,665
can buy lasting peace?

273
00:15:56,185 --> 00:15:57,905
When Ying Gua rejected
the marriage alliance,

274
00:15:58,465 --> 00:15:59,785
Beijian's honor

275
00:15:59,865 --> 00:16:01,425
was already trampled underfoot.

276
00:16:01,505 --> 00:16:04,545
A wolf does not wag its tail and beg.

277
00:16:05,465 --> 00:16:07,145
Only a dog does.

278
00:16:07,225 --> 00:16:08,905
For the past two years, Daning

279
00:16:08,985 --> 00:16:10,465
has poured troops into the border,

280
00:16:10,545 --> 00:16:11,705
stockpiling grain and
building fortifications.

281
00:16:12,425 --> 00:16:14,145
They may well be planning

282
00:16:14,225 --> 00:16:15,345
to trap us in the northern
desert until we die.

283
00:16:15,945 --> 00:16:17,505
This time, I will make Daning

284
00:16:17,585 --> 00:16:18,545
see for itself

285
00:16:18,625 --> 00:16:21,025
what Beijian's iron cavalry truly means.

286
00:16:21,505 --> 00:16:22,945
And I will prove to Father

287
00:16:23,625 --> 00:16:24,825
that the world

288
00:16:25,465 --> 00:16:27,065
is not won by kneeling and begging,

289
00:16:27,905 --> 00:16:30,785
but by fighting for it
with sword and steel.

290
00:16:30,865 --> 00:16:32,825
Your Highness, someone's coming.

291
00:17:19,705 --> 00:17:20,705
Sir.

292
00:17:21,705 --> 00:17:23,945
I've cleared up the misunderstanding
with Beijian's Second Prince

293
00:17:24,025 --> 00:17:26,145
and confirmed someone did
impersonate our Society

294
00:17:26,225 --> 00:17:27,145
to sabotage the alliance.

295
00:17:28,145 --> 00:17:29,145
The Second Prince of Beijian

296
00:17:29,225 --> 00:17:30,305
has agreed to join forces with us

297
00:17:30,385 --> 00:17:31,465
and continue the war against Daning.

298
00:17:32,065 --> 00:17:34,305
Their blood will not
have been shed in vain.

299
00:17:35,265 --> 00:17:37,225
Daning's blood debt

300
00:17:37,305 --> 00:17:40,985
must be repaid with mountains
of corpses and seas of blood.

301
00:17:48,025 --> 00:17:49,985
Daning's court is in turmoil now.

302
00:17:50,065 --> 00:17:51,745
Our Princess

303
00:17:51,825 --> 00:17:53,385
is about to rise to the pinnacle of power.

304
00:17:53,905 --> 00:17:56,505
Once her bloodline memories awaken,

305
00:17:56,985 --> 00:18:00,425
we will welcome the Princess at once

306
00:18:00,505 --> 00:18:02,025
and restore our realm.

307
00:18:02,825 --> 00:18:05,385
Welcome the Princess! Restore our realm!

308
00:18:05,465 --> 00:18:08,265
Welcome the Princess! Restore our realm!

309
00:18:08,345 --> 00:18:10,905
Welcome the Princess! Restore our realm!

310
00:18:10,985 --> 00:18:14,385
Welcome the Princess! Restore our realm!

311
00:19:03,465 --> 00:19:04,345
Grand Tutor!

312
00:19:04,905 --> 00:19:06,945
The Young Master's spirit has returned!

313
00:19:26,745 --> 00:19:27,585
Father.

314
00:19:28,065 --> 00:19:29,105
Mother.

315
00:19:29,905 --> 00:19:30,945
I'm home.

316
00:19:37,265 --> 00:19:38,105
Brother!

317
00:19:46,385 --> 00:19:47,225
Brother!

318
00:19:58,145 --> 00:19:59,305
Your unfilial son

319
00:20:00,065 --> 00:20:01,585
has made you worry.

320
00:20:03,505 --> 00:20:04,705
My son...

321
00:20:08,945 --> 00:20:10,065
You're home. That's all that matters.

322
00:20:10,625 --> 00:20:11,825
That's all that matters.

323
00:20:15,185 --> 00:20:16,225
My husband...

324
00:20:23,705 --> 00:20:24,705
Fuzhi.

325
00:20:42,265 --> 00:20:43,505
Shen Zhishu!

326
00:20:47,785 --> 00:20:49,665
You've gone too far!

327
00:20:49,745 --> 00:20:52,425
Do you know how many paper
offerings I burned for you?

328
00:20:52,505 --> 00:20:55,345
Do you know how heartbroken I was?

329
00:20:57,185 --> 00:20:59,465
How could you joke about life and death?

330
00:21:13,745 --> 00:21:14,665
Let me see.

331
00:21:15,985 --> 00:21:17,105
It'll frighten you.

332
00:21:35,945 --> 00:21:36,785
Father.

333
00:21:37,665 --> 00:21:38,585
Are you...

334
00:21:39,345 --> 00:21:40,185
disappointed in me?

335
00:21:41,905 --> 00:21:42,985
All your life, Father,

336
00:21:43,465 --> 00:21:44,505
you've achieved great things.

337
00:21:45,785 --> 00:21:47,625
I'm afraid I may never equal you.

338
00:21:50,105 --> 00:21:50,945
The only thing I had that could compare

339
00:21:51,985 --> 00:21:53,185
was this face of mine.

340
00:21:54,905 --> 00:21:56,705
Now I've lost even that advantage.

341
00:22:01,785 --> 00:22:03,625
You are the eldest son of the Shen family.

342
00:22:04,825 --> 00:22:06,705
You grew up studying beside His Majesty.

343
00:22:06,785 --> 00:22:08,265
At twenty,

344
00:22:09,065 --> 00:22:10,625
you could enter officialdom
through family privilege.

345
00:22:12,545 --> 00:22:14,185
Compared with scholars
born to humble families,

346
00:22:14,265 --> 00:22:16,025
you have been extraordinarily fortunate.

347
00:22:16,105 --> 00:22:18,705
But with the honor of such a family name,

348
00:22:18,785 --> 00:22:21,385
you must possess civil talent

349
00:22:21,465 --> 00:22:22,905
as well as martial skill.

350
00:22:23,465 --> 00:22:25,665
As His Majesty's trusted friend,

351
00:22:26,345 --> 00:22:28,785
you must never openly hunger for power,

352
00:22:28,865 --> 00:22:30,745
but neither can you be
wholly without ambition.

353
00:22:31,345 --> 00:22:32,505
More importantly,

354
00:22:32,585 --> 00:22:34,265
on your shoulders rests

355
00:22:34,345 --> 00:22:35,985
the entire Shen clan

356
00:22:36,065 --> 00:22:38,265
and the duty to carry its honor forward.

357
00:22:41,345 --> 00:22:43,505
I demanded so much of you

358
00:22:43,585 --> 00:22:46,545
because I feared one achievement
would make you complacent.

359
00:22:46,625 --> 00:22:47,705
That is why I...

360
00:22:50,105 --> 00:22:52,145
why I kept putting you down.

361
00:22:55,825 --> 00:22:57,465
After hearing what happened to you,

362
00:22:59,305 --> 00:23:01,145
there was something I kept wanting to say.

363
00:23:04,905 --> 00:23:07,185
You are the pride of the Shen family.

364
00:23:10,305 --> 00:23:11,385
I was wrong.

365
00:23:19,345 --> 00:23:20,585
I never thought

366
00:23:21,545 --> 00:23:24,425
I'd hear the words "I was wrong"
from a stubborn old man like you.

367
00:23:26,665 --> 00:23:28,425
If I'd come back half a month later,

368
00:23:29,065 --> 00:23:30,705
would you have handed the
whole Shen family over to me?

369
00:23:31,385 --> 00:23:32,225
You little...

370
00:23:34,785 --> 00:23:36,145
You little rascal.

371
00:23:38,665 --> 00:23:39,585
That must hurt terribly.

372
00:23:42,985 --> 00:23:45,025
Compared with the beatings
Father gave me as a boy,

373
00:23:45,105 --> 00:23:47,265
this is nothing.

374
00:24:01,745 --> 00:24:04,025
Though I was wounded,
misfortune brought a blessing.

375
00:24:05,265 --> 00:24:06,905
I was carrying the Blood
Moon Society's scepter

376
00:24:06,985 --> 00:24:08,545
when members of the
Society found and saved me.

377
00:24:09,025 --> 00:24:10,905
While recovering among them,

378
00:24:10,985 --> 00:24:12,345
I learned something important.

379
00:24:12,425 --> 00:24:14,105
Mr. Shangguan of the Blood Moon Society

380
00:24:14,185 --> 00:24:15,065
is not only alive,

381
00:24:15,145 --> 00:24:16,825
he is hiding among the officials at court.

382
00:24:19,265 --> 00:24:20,585
I should have known.

383
00:24:21,185 --> 00:24:22,665
A man like him would never die so easily.

384
00:24:22,745 --> 00:24:25,065
Your Majesty, shall we investigate
the entire court at once?

385
00:24:26,065 --> 00:24:28,265
If we mishandle this, the
ministers will turn on each other.

386
00:24:28,345 --> 00:24:31,065
Then if the Blood Moon Society
and Beijian strike together,

387
00:24:31,145 --> 00:24:32,905
we'll face enemies within and without.

388
00:24:32,985 --> 00:24:34,825
But the marriage proposal
from Beijian's First Prince

389
00:24:34,905 --> 00:24:36,825
clearly shows he broke with
the Blood Moon Society first.

390
00:24:37,745 --> 00:24:39,705
Mr. Shangguan is colluding
with the Second Prince.

391
00:24:40,385 --> 00:24:41,545
Most likely.

392
00:24:41,625 --> 00:24:43,905
I've heard the Second Prince has never
gotten along with his elder brother.

393
00:24:43,985 --> 00:24:45,905
And compared with the First Prince,

394
00:24:45,985 --> 00:24:47,305
he is far more warlike.

395
00:24:47,385 --> 00:24:49,865
His intentions are hard to fathom.
We cannot let our guard down.

396
00:24:49,945 --> 00:24:51,105
Whatever happens,

397
00:24:51,185 --> 00:24:52,225
if Your Majesty rejects
this marriage alliance,

398
00:24:52,305 --> 00:24:53,985
war on the frontier may be unavoidable.

399
00:24:54,065 --> 00:24:55,505
What inch of this realm

400
00:24:55,585 --> 00:24:57,545
was not won by sword and cavalry?

401
00:24:58,305 --> 00:24:59,305
Beijian has a wolf's nature.

402
00:24:59,385 --> 00:25:00,745
Whichever prince it is,

403
00:25:00,825 --> 00:25:02,545
if he can secretly collude
with the Blood Moon Society,

404
00:25:02,625 --> 00:25:04,145
why would he keep his word later?

405
00:25:05,025 --> 00:25:06,465
This marriage proposal

406
00:25:06,545 --> 00:25:08,345
only proves they fear
our frontier cavalry.

407
00:25:08,985 --> 00:25:11,225
The misunderstanding between
Beijian and the Blood Moon Society

408
00:25:11,305 --> 00:25:12,905
will be exposed sooner or later.

409
00:25:12,985 --> 00:25:14,145
My father once said

410
00:25:14,225 --> 00:25:16,225
Beijian is ravenous and
deceitful, full of schemes.

411
00:25:17,505 --> 00:25:18,665
I am ready to go to war at any time.

412
00:25:18,745 --> 00:25:20,225
But before that,

413
00:25:20,305 --> 00:25:21,585
we must find Shangguan.

414
00:25:21,665 --> 00:25:23,065
I suspect Shangguan

415
00:25:25,025 --> 00:25:26,505
is someone close to us.

416
00:25:29,625 --> 00:25:31,985
When Your Majesty first
ascended the throne,

417
00:25:32,065 --> 00:25:33,545
I had not yet entered the court.

418
00:25:33,625 --> 00:25:36,425
Yet I boldly asked for a post
at the Office of Public Inquiry

419
00:25:38,745 --> 00:25:40,225
and was even rebuked by Your Majesty.

420
00:25:43,785 --> 00:25:45,385
I still remember looking at you then,

421
00:25:46,305 --> 00:25:47,465
so outrageously bold,

422
00:25:48,145 --> 00:25:49,745
and knowing no one but you

423
00:25:49,825 --> 00:25:50,785
could lead the Office of Public Inquiry.

424
00:25:51,985 --> 00:25:52,825
And now,

425
00:25:54,345 --> 00:25:56,265
you've fulfilled every word you said then.

426
00:25:57,305 --> 00:25:58,665
In fact, you've done

427
00:26:00,705 --> 00:26:01,545
even better than I expected.

428
00:26:04,265 --> 00:26:06,545
When I entered the court,
I had no attachments.

429
00:26:07,305 --> 00:26:09,185
Only Fuzhi was someone I worried about.

430
00:26:10,025 --> 00:26:11,825
That was why I never hesitated.

431
00:26:12,705 --> 00:26:14,865
Exhuming bodies, investigating cases,

432
00:26:14,945 --> 00:26:16,065
pursuing Ling Yunfei...

433
00:26:16,145 --> 00:26:18,185
I never once faltered.

434
00:26:18,265 --> 00:26:19,665
But now,

435
00:26:20,665 --> 00:26:22,345
there are more people I want to protect.

436
00:26:23,465 --> 00:26:25,065
So I've learned what fear is.

437
00:26:27,785 --> 00:26:29,105
We're both afraid of losing those we love.

438
00:26:29,985 --> 00:26:31,385
These past days,

439
00:26:31,465 --> 00:26:32,745
I have watched helplessly

440
00:26:32,825 --> 00:26:35,345
as one person after another
close to me was taken away.

441
00:26:40,385 --> 00:26:41,505
What happened to Zhishu

442
00:26:44,625 --> 00:26:46,305
has made me more afraid than ever.

443
00:27:13,025 --> 00:27:14,465
I may possess this entire realm,

444
00:27:16,185 --> 00:27:18,265
yet perhaps I still can't
keep the people I treasure.

445
00:27:25,505 --> 00:27:27,425
I won't leave Your Majesty.

446
00:27:28,065 --> 00:27:30,265
I want to remain at the
Office of Public Inquiry

447
00:27:30,345 --> 00:27:31,385
and continue serving you.

448
00:27:42,785 --> 00:27:43,745
Meng Tinghui.

449
00:27:45,385 --> 00:27:46,825
Let's get married.

450
00:27:49,425 --> 00:27:51,585
The court is settled now.

451
00:27:51,665 --> 00:27:53,105
No one can stand in our way anymore.

452
00:27:54,265 --> 00:27:55,665
This hairpin...

453
00:27:55,745 --> 00:27:57,625
I spent three months making it myself.

454
00:27:57,705 --> 00:27:59,545
I've waited to place it in
your hair and crown you,

455
00:28:00,065 --> 00:28:01,025
then proclaim you to the entire realm.

456
00:28:05,105 --> 00:28:06,145
Your Majesty.

457
00:28:07,025 --> 00:28:08,065
Right now,

458
00:28:08,905 --> 00:28:10,145
I cannot marry you.

459
00:28:11,105 --> 00:28:11,945
Why?

460
00:28:12,025 --> 00:28:13,185
Your Majesty knows me.

461
00:28:14,625 --> 00:28:15,945
Everything I've fought for

462
00:28:17,025 --> 00:28:19,225
was to root out entrenched abuses
throughout the court and government.

463
00:28:19,305 --> 00:28:20,985
The Blood Moon Society seeks

464
00:28:21,065 --> 00:28:22,905
to overthrow Daning itself.

465
00:28:22,985 --> 00:28:24,905
What frightens me even more

466
00:28:25,425 --> 00:28:27,385
is that Shangguan is
hidden within the court.

467
00:28:28,185 --> 00:28:29,745
So I beg Your Majesty

468
00:28:29,825 --> 00:28:32,345
to let me investigate the
Blood Moon Society thoroughly.

469
00:28:32,425 --> 00:28:33,305
Ask me for anything else.

470
00:28:33,385 --> 00:28:34,745
But not the Blood Moon Society.

471
00:28:35,745 --> 00:28:37,305
I have given the Blood Moon Society case

472
00:28:37,385 --> 00:28:39,265
entirely to Zhishu.

473
00:28:39,345 --> 00:28:41,385
Your Majesty is hiding something from me.

474
00:28:43,465 --> 00:28:45,025
I once asked Your Majesty

475
00:28:45,865 --> 00:28:47,665
whether we had truly opened
our hearts to each other.

476
00:28:48,545 --> 00:28:49,505
So it turns out...

477
00:28:50,825 --> 00:28:51,905
we haven't.

478
00:28:52,945 --> 00:28:54,305
The burden of the realm is immense.

479
00:28:54,905 --> 00:28:56,145
The palace has depths upon depths.

480
00:28:56,745 --> 00:28:57,705
Even to you,

481
00:29:00,865 --> 00:29:03,465
I cannot lay every
secret of my heart bare.

482
00:29:09,105 --> 00:29:10,465
I will take my leave.

483
00:29:37,265 --> 00:29:38,345
Shen Zhishu!

484
00:29:39,025 --> 00:29:40,785
How long are you going to hide from me?

485
00:29:42,905 --> 00:29:44,065
Fuzhi.

486
00:29:44,145 --> 00:29:45,105
We should part.

487
00:29:48,705 --> 00:29:49,665
Don't come looking for me again.

488
00:29:54,985 --> 00:29:56,265
Part?

489
00:30:01,865 --> 00:30:03,665
What about the marriage
contract you wrote yourself?

490
00:30:06,345 --> 00:30:07,465
Are you taking it back?

491
00:30:12,505 --> 00:30:13,585
I failed to keep our promise.

492
00:30:15,185 --> 00:30:16,825
I came back scarred.

493
00:30:17,385 --> 00:30:18,585
Even my face...

494
00:30:19,145 --> 00:30:20,745
It's only a scar.

495
00:30:21,665 --> 00:30:23,345
A real man can weather far worse.

496
00:30:23,425 --> 00:30:24,785
What's the big deal?

497
00:30:31,305 --> 00:30:32,705
I think

498
00:30:33,385 --> 00:30:34,785
that scar

499
00:30:35,385 --> 00:30:36,865
makes you look even more gallant.

500
00:30:37,425 --> 00:30:38,585
I'm serious.

501
00:30:38,665 --> 00:30:39,865
As a minister,

502
00:30:40,585 --> 00:30:42,345
I gave up any fear of death long ago.

503
00:30:45,625 --> 00:30:47,385
Daning now faces dangers
within and without.

504
00:30:47,465 --> 00:30:49,425
The Shen clan bears a heavy duty.

505
00:30:51,185 --> 00:30:52,945
The next time I carry out an assignment,

506
00:30:53,025 --> 00:30:54,425
I may suffer far worse than a wound.

507
00:31:18,905 --> 00:31:20,225
Then I'll wait for you to come back.

508
00:31:21,745 --> 00:31:22,825
And if you never do,

509
00:31:24,105 --> 00:31:25,305
I'll wait for you for the rest of my life.

510
00:31:29,505 --> 00:31:30,945
I loved the flirtatious young lord

511
00:31:32,225 --> 00:31:35,025
who once drunkenly picked flowers for me.

512
00:31:36,265 --> 00:31:37,505
Of course I did.

513
00:31:41,225 --> 00:31:42,385
But now,

514
00:31:42,865 --> 00:31:45,785
this brave man with a scar on his face

515
00:31:46,945 --> 00:31:48,305
makes my heart ache even more

516
00:31:52,145 --> 00:31:53,705
and is worth loving for a lifetime.

517
00:32:22,065 --> 00:32:22,905
Mengmeng.

518
00:32:22,985 --> 00:32:23,945
His Majesty truly

519
00:32:24,025 --> 00:32:25,585
treats you wonderfully.

520
00:32:25,665 --> 00:32:27,905
He even granted you this
imperial hot spring.

521
00:32:27,985 --> 00:32:29,185
And that's not even mentioning

522
00:32:29,265 --> 00:32:30,945
how he overturned ancestral law for you.

523
00:32:31,025 --> 00:32:32,665
That shook the entire realm.

524
00:32:32,745 --> 00:32:34,105
Who wouldn't envy you?

525
00:32:34,785 --> 00:32:37,585
When did you become his advocate?

526
00:32:42,585 --> 00:32:45,425
Now even my closest friend

527
00:32:45,505 --> 00:32:46,745
has been won over by him.

528
00:32:47,905 --> 00:32:48,825
It seems behind my back,

529
00:32:48,905 --> 00:32:50,825
I truly have no one left.

530
00:32:52,985 --> 00:32:54,425
Dear Mengmeng.

531
00:32:56,505 --> 00:32:58,705
Whatever happens in the future,

532
00:32:58,785 --> 00:33:00,265
I will always stand behind you.

533
00:33:01,105 --> 00:33:03,625
What matters to me isn't
some grand principle.

534
00:33:03,705 --> 00:33:05,305
It's you.

535
00:33:05,945 --> 00:33:07,265
It's just that

536
00:33:07,345 --> 00:33:08,985
I truly think there is
no one in this world

537
00:33:09,065 --> 00:33:10,385
worthy of standing beside you

538
00:33:10,465 --> 00:33:11,545
except His Majesty.

539
00:33:13,345 --> 00:33:15,105
I've seen how hard

540
00:33:15,185 --> 00:33:16,705
you've fought to come this far.

541
00:33:17,345 --> 00:33:19,305
That's why I still wish

542
00:33:19,385 --> 00:33:21,585
there were someone powerful
enough to protect you.

543
00:33:22,425 --> 00:33:23,265
Fuzhi.

544
00:33:24,905 --> 00:33:26,105
Marrying His Majesty

545
00:33:26,745 --> 00:33:29,425
means placing myself under
countless watching eyes

546
00:33:30,265 --> 00:33:31,585
and accusing fingers.

547
00:33:34,825 --> 00:33:36,345
If I become Empress,

548
00:33:37,265 --> 00:33:39,145
even one extra word with him

549
00:33:40,065 --> 00:33:41,385
would have the entire court saying

550
00:33:41,465 --> 00:33:43,665
the Empress is meddling in state affairs.

551
00:33:44,625 --> 00:33:47,025
I don't want the glory of an
Empress's crown and robes.

552
00:33:48,305 --> 00:33:50,545
I want to stand openly
and honorably in court.

553
00:33:51,985 --> 00:33:53,945
I want him to become a
wise ruler for the ages.

554
00:33:55,145 --> 00:33:57,665
But I won't sacrifice half
a lifetime of ambition

555
00:33:58,185 --> 00:33:59,625
to be confined behind the Empress's seal.

556
00:34:02,225 --> 00:34:04,145
Of course I understand.

557
00:34:05,385 --> 00:34:06,585
It's just...

558
00:34:07,145 --> 00:34:09,105
do you truly not want to marry him?

559
00:34:11,785 --> 00:34:13,745
All right. I won't say any more.

560
00:34:13,825 --> 00:34:15,705
Let's not talk about
things that trouble you.

561
00:34:15,785 --> 00:34:17,625
Today, let's just...

562
00:34:17,705 --> 00:34:18,745
relax and enjoy ourselves.

563
00:34:30,185 --> 00:34:31,385
Mengmeng.

564
00:34:31,905 --> 00:34:33,425
When did you get that mark on your body?

565
00:34:33,505 --> 00:34:34,785
What mark?

566
00:34:34,865 --> 00:34:36,385
It looks like a bird.

567
00:34:36,465 --> 00:34:37,665
A red one.

568
00:34:37,745 --> 00:34:39,545
A red bird?

569
00:34:51,785 --> 00:34:53,585
This mark on your back

570
00:34:53,665 --> 00:34:55,025
is rather unusual.

571
00:34:55,105 --> 00:34:56,225
Which mark do you mean, Your Majesty?

572
00:34:56,305 --> 00:34:57,465
This drawing.

573
00:34:57,545 --> 00:34:58,625
Do you recognize it?

574
00:35:04,305 --> 00:35:05,145
Yao'er.

575
00:35:06,225 --> 00:35:07,865
Brother Shangguan.

576
00:35:10,905 --> 00:35:12,825
That's my father's Black Bird.

577
00:35:12,905 --> 00:35:15,625
It's the most powerful divine bird of all.

578
00:35:15,705 --> 00:35:18,345
Brother, draw one for me too.

579
00:35:18,425 --> 00:35:21,305
Draw one even bigger than the Black Bird.

580
00:35:22,025 --> 00:35:22,985
No.

581
00:35:23,065 --> 00:35:24,505
My husband has to draw mine first.

582
00:35:24,585 --> 00:35:26,985
Draw my Black Bird in red.

583
00:35:27,065 --> 00:35:29,025
My brother won't draw one for you.

584
00:35:29,105 --> 00:35:30,665
-My brother is mine!
-No, he isn't!

585
00:35:30,745 --> 00:35:32,025
My father said

586
00:35:32,105 --> 00:35:33,065
Brother Shangguan

587
00:35:33,145 --> 00:35:34,425
will be my husband someday.

588
00:35:34,505 --> 00:35:36,465
-Brother Shangguan is mine!
-He's mine!

589
00:35:38,025 --> 00:35:39,305
Yao'er, quickly!

590
00:35:43,385 --> 00:35:44,985
Someone's over there. After them!

591
00:35:47,025 --> 00:35:47,985
Are you all right?

592
00:35:48,465 --> 00:35:50,425
Brother Shangguan.

593
00:35:50,505 --> 00:35:52,425
-Your hand...
-Keep your voice down.

594
00:35:52,505 --> 00:35:53,945
Where's little Xixia?

595
00:35:54,825 --> 00:35:56,225
She died in your place.

596
00:36:00,945 --> 00:36:02,785
Yao'er, remember this.

597
00:36:02,865 --> 00:36:04,105
You must live.

598
00:36:04,185 --> 00:36:06,345
Forget today. Forget who you are.

599
00:36:06,905 --> 00:36:08,985
Retreat! Quickly!

600
00:36:10,625 --> 00:36:13,385
Brother Shangguan!

601
00:36:40,185 --> 00:36:41,225
What happened?

602
00:36:53,465 --> 00:36:54,305
What's wrong?

603
00:36:55,385 --> 00:36:56,305
Your Majesty.

604
00:36:57,145 --> 00:36:58,825
Let's marry.

605
00:37:12,545 --> 00:37:14,185
Have you thought this through?

606
00:37:14,905 --> 00:37:16,265
I don't want you to force yourself.

607
00:37:44,545 --> 00:37:45,945
By Heaven's mandate,

608
00:37:46,025 --> 00:37:47,385
I rule all under Heaven.

609
00:37:47,465 --> 00:37:48,785
Meng Tinghui of the Meng clan

610
00:37:48,865 --> 00:37:50,465
is valiant and virtuous,

611
00:37:50,545 --> 00:37:51,665
possessing noble character

612
00:37:51,745 --> 00:37:53,265
and truly fit to embody
the virtues of an Empress.

613
00:37:53,345 --> 00:37:55,105
I hereby invest her as Empress,

614
00:37:55,185 --> 00:37:56,265
to serve as mother of the realm.

615
00:37:56,345 --> 00:37:58,785
The proper offices shall choose an
auspicious day and prepare the Six Rites.

616
00:37:58,865 --> 00:38:00,985
I shall personally ride forth
in the imperial carriage

617
00:38:01,065 --> 00:38:01,985
to welcome her into the Central Palace.

618
00:38:02,065 --> 00:38:04,225
Let this decree be carried out.

619
00:38:26,185 --> 00:38:27,025
Yin Qing.

620
00:38:43,225 --> 00:38:44,425
Three years...

621
00:38:45,985 --> 00:38:47,465
and I never once noticed

622
00:38:47,545 --> 00:38:49,145
the scar on your hand.

623
00:38:55,785 --> 00:38:57,825
You devoted yourself
entirely to punishing evil.

624
00:38:58,585 --> 00:39:00,545
Why would you notice such a small detail?

625
00:39:00,625 --> 00:39:01,905
But

626
00:39:03,025 --> 00:39:04,665
everything has its proper time.

627
00:39:06,065 --> 00:39:08,425
Seeing it now is not too late.

628
00:39:09,105 --> 00:39:11,265
Some choices could have...

629
00:39:11,345 --> 00:39:12,625
Some choices,

630
00:39:13,585 --> 00:39:14,785
once I've made them,

631
00:39:15,425 --> 00:39:16,745
I never turn back.

632
00:39:20,945 --> 00:39:22,745
This newly compiled Records of the Realm

633
00:39:22,825 --> 00:39:23,985
states in its third chapter

634
00:39:24,065 --> 00:39:26,225
that after the waterworks in Daning's
seven prefectures were completed,

635
00:39:26,305 --> 00:39:28,345
grain output rose by thirty percent.

636
00:39:29,745 --> 00:39:30,865
Have you read it?

637
00:39:33,385 --> 00:39:35,385
I only wonder whether that extra grain

638
00:39:36,665 --> 00:39:38,465
can fill the bellies of those

639
00:39:38,545 --> 00:39:40,745
forced to dig the canals
and build the dikes.

640
00:39:41,625 --> 00:39:43,225
Beneath prosperity,

641
00:39:43,305 --> 00:39:44,385
there are always shadows.

642
00:39:46,785 --> 00:39:48,185
These past years, Daning

643
00:39:48,265 --> 00:39:49,665
has indeed been peaceful and prosperous.

644
00:39:52,905 --> 00:39:54,265
Peaceful and prosperous?

645
00:39:55,225 --> 00:39:56,825
Beneath the scent of ink,

646
00:39:56,905 --> 00:39:58,585
how much blood and how
many tears are hidden?

647
00:39:59,385 --> 00:40:00,945
This peace written on paper...

648
00:40:01,785 --> 00:40:03,385
how many bones lie cold beneath it?

649
00:40:08,105 --> 00:40:09,265
I live in Daning.

650
00:40:10,105 --> 00:40:11,185
As one of its people,

651
00:40:11,785 --> 00:40:13,745
I have watched Daning grow
more prosperous each day,

652
00:40:13,825 --> 00:40:14,945
the state wealthy and its people strong.

653
00:40:15,025 --> 00:40:16,385
And as an official,

654
00:40:17,105 --> 00:40:18,785
I've watched His Majesty
labor from dawn until night

655
00:40:18,865 --> 00:40:20,545
so his people may live and work in peace.

656
00:40:20,625 --> 00:40:22,585
The peace we seek

657
00:40:23,345 --> 00:40:24,745
is not far away.

658
00:40:24,825 --> 00:40:27,265
And what of those who
won't live to see it?

659
00:40:40,145 --> 00:40:40,985
I believe

660
00:40:42,425 --> 00:40:44,385
the rain will soon pass
and the skies will clear.

661
00:40:44,465 --> 00:40:45,985
The Rain Bell

662
00:40:46,945 --> 00:40:48,505
was made to create illusions.

663
00:40:49,105 --> 00:40:50,105
You've stared at it for so long

664
00:40:50,825 --> 00:40:51,665
that you've forgotten

665
00:40:51,745 --> 00:40:53,545
the rain never stopped.

666
00:40:59,305 --> 00:41:02,385
Even this rainbow is false.

667
00:41:42,545 --> 00:41:43,625
Mengmeng.

668
00:41:49,345 --> 00:41:50,385
Our Director Meng, who wouldn't blink

669
00:41:50,465 --> 00:41:52,225
even if Mount Tai collapsed before her,

670
00:41:52,305 --> 00:41:54,185
can actually get so
nervous her hands shake.

671
00:41:55,065 --> 00:41:56,865
You are marrying the Emperor of Daning.

672
00:41:56,945 --> 00:41:58,545
I wouldn't believe you if
you said you weren't nervous.

673
00:42:01,545 --> 00:42:03,945
Come. Tonight, we don't
stop until we're drunk.

674
00:42:04,905 --> 00:42:05,745
Cheers!

675
00:42:19,905 --> 00:42:21,465
-Cheers!
-Come on.

